---
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CuriosityGenerator from '../components/CuriosityGenerator';
import SurveyDashboard from '../components/SurveyDashboard';
import SpecimenSheet from '../components/SpecimenSheet.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import curious from '../assets/pathways/curious.jpg';
import investigate from '../assets/pathways/investigate.jpg';
import { featuredObservation as feature } from '../data/featuredObservation';
import { loadFeaturedSheet } from '../data/featuredSheet';

const { data: sheet } = await loadFeaturedSheet();
const town = sheet.locality.split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean).slice(-2, -1)[0] || sheet.locality;
const inatUrl = `https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/${sheet.id}`;
const journey = [
  [sheet.observed, `Photographed and posted to iNaturalist, #${sheet.id}`],
  ...(sheet.its?.plate || sheet.its?.tech ? [['Sequenced', [sheet.its?.plate && `Mycota Lab, plate ${sheet.its.plate}`, sheet.its?.tech && sheet.its?.reads && `${sheet.its.tech}, ${sheet.its.reads} reads in consensus`].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')]] : []),
  ...(sheet.its ? [['Read', `${sheet.its.length} letters of the ITS barcode region`]] : []),
  ...(sheet.provisional ? [['Named', `${sheet.name.replace(/^\S+\s+sp\.\s*/, '')}, a provisional name until the species is formally described`]] : []),
];
---
<Base title="See fungi differently" description="MycoView is a field station for fungal discovery, citizen science, original evidence, research tools and collaboration.">
<div class="hp">

  <section class="hp-hero" aria-labelledby="hp-title">
    <div class="hp-hero-copy">
      <h1 id="hp-title">See fungi differently.</h1>
      <p class="hp-lede">Every discovery starts with a collection. {sheet.provisional
        ? <>These mushrooms from {town} carry only a provisional name: their DNA isn't yet matched to a described species.</>
        : <>This one comes from {town}.</>}</p>
      <p class="hp-sub">MycoView shows how a photo becomes a specimen, and a specimen becomes evidence. You can do it too.</p>
      <div class="hp-actions">
        <a class="hp-btn" href="#start">Start exploring</a>
        <a class="hp-link" href="/investigate/#workbench">Open the Research Toolbox</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hp-aside">No credentials required. Just curiosity.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hp-hero-sheet">
      <SpecimenSheet data={sheet} photo={feature.heroImage} photoAlt={feature.heroAlt} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <aside class="hp-inat" aria-label="Built on iNaturalist">
    <p><strong>Built on iNaturalist.</strong> Everything on MycoView starts with community observations on <a href="https://www.inaturalist.org/">iNaturalist</a>, and helps turn them into evidence: specimens, DNA sequences, new names and reports a land manager can act on. <a href="https://help.inaturalist.org/">New to iNaturalist? Start here</a>.</p>
  </aside>

  <section class="hp-wrap" aria-labelledby="hp-journey-title">
    <div class="hp-logbook">
      <h2 id="hp-journey-title">How this collection became evidence</h2>
      <ol>
        {journey.map(([k, v]) => <li><span class="hp-key">{k}</span><span>{v}</span></li>)}
      </ol>
      <p class="hp-logbook-links">
        <a href={inatUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See the iNaturalist record</a>
        <a href="/one-place/">{feature.question}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="start" class="hp-wrap hp-split" aria-labelledby="hp-open-title">
    <div>
      <h2 id="hp-open-title">The woods don't care about your credentials.</h2>
      <p>But they reward attention. A mushroom you can't name, a pattern you can't explain, a person who sees something you've missed: each is a beginning. Start wherever you are. Go as deep as you like.</p>
      <p><a class="hp-link" href="/learn/">Try a different way of looking</a></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="hp-print">
      <Image src={curious} alt="Detailed purple gills of a wild mushroom seen from below" widths={[460, 800]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 92vw, 42vw" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>Look closer: the details change the story.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="hp-wrap" aria-labelledby="hp-now-title">
    <h2 id="hp-now-title">An observation is only the beginning</h2>
    <div class="hp-two">
      <article class="hp-card hp-story">
        <Image src={investigate} alt="A camera documenting a cluster of mushrooms in the forest" widths={[440, 760]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 92vw, 30vw" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <h3>When does a name outrun the evidence?</h3>
          <p>What can a photograph really tell us about a species? Explore provisional names, DNA barcodes, and why a confident identification isn't always the same as a well-supported one.</p>
          <p><a class="hp-link" href="/investigate/provisional-taxonomist/">Follow the question</a></p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="hp-card hp-play">
        <h3>The Curiosity Generator</h3>
        <p>Small, playful experiments to notice what you might otherwise miss. No scores. No leaderboard. No wrong starting point.</p>
        <CuriosityGenerator client:visible />
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hp-wrap hp-split hp-guide" aria-labelledby="hp-guide-title">
    <figure class="hp-print hp-portrait">
      <Photo src="mycogeeky-field-curiosity.jpg" alt="MycoGeeky in the field, excitedly comparing two wild mushrooms" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <figcaption>Stay curious. Stay cultivating.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div>
      <h2 id="hp-guide-title">Hi, I'm MycoGeeky.</h2>
      <p class="hp-lede">I spend an unreasonable amount of time asking questions about fungi, chasing mushrooms through forests, and talking to people who know considerably more than I do.</p>
      <p>This is where I share what we're discovering, build tools to help us investigate, and invite you to join the adventure. The best part isn't collecting answers. It's finding people worth asking questions with.</p>
      <p class="hp-links"><a class="hp-link" href="/about/">Get to know your guide</a><a class="hp-link" href="/connect/">Find your people</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hp-lab" data-tier="lab" data-theme="day" aria-labelledby="hp-lab-title">
    <div class="hp-wrap">
      <h2 id="hp-lab-title">Real questions deserve real tools</h2>
      <p class="hp-lab-intro">Evaluate a claim, trace an original source, or add to a growing body of field records. You can learn the methods before you ever open a tool.</p>
      <div class="hp-lab-grid">
        <a class="hp-panel hp-panel-main" href="/investigate/research-navigator/">
          <h3>Research Navigator</h3>
          <p>Fifteen guided research frameworks across ecology, taxonomy, morphology, molecular evidence and biodiversity: what would it take to find out?</p>
        </a>
        <a class="hp-panel" href="/investigate/resources/">
          <h3>Find the original evidence</h3>
          <p>Names, specimens, literature and sequence databases, with when each is useful.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="hp-panel" href="/investigate/learn/">
          <h3>Learn to think like a mycologist</h3>
          <p>From field notes to collection curation: what makes an observation scientifically useful.</p>
        </a>
        <div class="hp-panel hp-panel-survey">
          <SurveyDashboard client:visible />
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="hp-lab-more"><a class="hp-link" href="/investigate/#workbench">See every tool in the Research Toolbox</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hp-wrap hp-split hp-community" aria-labelledby="hp-community-title">
    <figure class="hp-print">
      <Photo src="crane-hollow-1.jpg" alt="Field adventurers standing beneath the sandstone overhang at Crane Hollow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </figure>
    <div>
      <h2 id="hp-community-title">Come for the mushrooms. Stay for the people.</h2>
      <p>The MycoView channel brings conversations, field stories and science to video. NEO Myco, the Northeast Ohio club launching in 2027, will turn shared questions into collaborative research. And MycoGeeky's podcast history is proof that a good conversation can grow into a lasting friendship.</p>
      <p class="hp-links"><a class="hp-btn" href="/neo-myco/">Meet NEO Myco</a><a class="hp-link" href="/discover/#watch-and-listen">Watch and listen</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</Base>

<style is:global>
.hp { background: var(--ds-ground); color: var(--ds-ink); padding-bottom: var(--ds-space-8); }
.hp-wrap { width: min(1360px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--ds-space-8) 0 0; }
.hp h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 46px); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 72%; margin: 0 0 var(--ds-space-4); }
.hp h3 { font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 75%; margin: 0 0 10px; }
.hp p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 62ch; }
.hp a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
.hp-lede { font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 1.5 !important; }

.hp-hero { width: min(1360px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--ds-space-7) 0 var(--ds-space-6); display: flex; flex-direction: row-reverse; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 40px 56px; }
.hp-hero-copy { flex: 1 1 360px; min-width: 0; }
.hp-hero-sheet { flex: 1.6 1 600px; min-width: 0; }
.hp-hero h1 { margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: clamp(60px, 8vw, 108px); line-height: .9; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 72%; text-wrap: balance; }
.hp-sub { color: var(--ds-ink-muted); }
.hp-actions, .hp-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px 28px; margin: 28px 0 0; }
.hp-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 56px; padding: 0 30px; background: var(--ds-action); color: var(--ds-action-ink) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; }
.hp-link { font-weight: 600; padding: 10px 0; display: inline-block; }
.hp-aside { font-family: var(--ds-font-mono); color: var(--ds-ink-muted); margin-top: 22px; }

.hp-inat { width: min(1360px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: var(--ds-space-5) auto 0; background: var(--ds-paper-card); color: var(--ds-paper-ink); box-shadow: var(--ds-shadow-card); padding: 16px 22px; }
.hp-inat p { margin: 0; max-width: none; font-size: 16px; }

.hp-logbook { background: var(--ds-paper-card); color: var(--ds-paper-ink); box-shadow: var(--ds-shadow-paper); padding: 40px clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) 30px clamp(44px, 7vw, 96px); position: relative; }
.hp-logbook::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: clamp(28px, 4.6vw, 64px); width: 2px; background: var(--ds-rule-margin); }
.hp-logbook h2 { padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-rule-ledger); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.hp-logbook ol { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-family: var(--ds-font-mono); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }
.hp-logbook li { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 24px; padding: 9px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-rule-ledger); }
.hp-key { width: 160px; font-weight: 700; }
.hp-logbook li > span:last-child { flex: 1 1 280px; }
.hp-logbook-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 28px; margin: 18px 0 0; font-weight: 600; }

.hp-split { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 36px 56px; }
.hp-split > * { flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; }
.hp-print { margin: 0; background: var(--ds-paper-card); padding: 10px 10px 8px; box-shadow: var(--ds-shadow-paper); color: var(--ds-paper-ink); }
.hp-print img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 520px; object-fit: cover; }
.hp-print figcaption { font-family: var(--ds-font-mono); font-size: 15px; padding: 8px 4px 2px; }
.hp-portrait img { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-position: 50% 45%; max-height: 600px; }
.hp-community .hp-print img { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-position: 50% 0%; }

.hp-two { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px; align-items: stretch; }
.hp-card { flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; background: var(--ds-paper-card); color: var(--ds-paper-ink); box-shadow: var(--ds-shadow-paper); padding: 24px; }
.hp-story { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; padding: 0; }
.hp-story img { flex: 1 1 220px; min-width: 0; width: 100%; height: auto; min-height: 220px; object-fit: cover; }
.hp-story > div { flex: 1 1 260px; padding: 24px 24px 20px 0; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .hp-story > div { padding: 0 20px 20px; } }
.hp-play .curiosity-generator { background: var(--ds-paper-card-warm); border: 1px solid var(--ds-rule-ledger); border-radius: 0; box-shadow: none; padding: 20px; margin-top: 14px; }
.hp-play .curiosity-generator h3 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.hp-play .curiosity-insight { border-left: 0; background: var(--ds-paper-sheet); padding: 12px 14px; }
.hp-play .button { border-radius: 0; font: 600 16px var(--ds-font-body); min-height: 48px; padding: 0 20px; }
.hp-play .button.primary { background: var(--ds-paper-ink); border-color: var(--ds-paper-ink); color: #fff; }
.hp-play .button.outline { background: transparent; border: 2px solid var(--ds-paper-ink); color: var(--ds-paper-ink); }
.hp-play .curiosity-disclaimer { color: var(--ds-paper-ink-muted); font-size: 14px; }

.hp-lab { margin-top: var(--ds-space-8); background: var(--ds-ground); color: var(--ds-ink); padding-bottom: var(--ds-space-8); border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-line-subtle); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ds-line-subtle); }
.hp-lab h2 { font-stretch: 80%; }
.hp-lab-intro { color: var(--ds-ink-muted); }
.hp-lab-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 340px), 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 28px; }
.hp-panel { display: block; background: var(--ds-panel); border: 1px solid var(--ds-line-subtle); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-lg); padding: 22px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
a.hp-panel:hover h3 { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
.hp-panel p { color: var(--ds-ink-muted); font-size: 16px; margin: 0; }
.hp-panel-main { border-color: var(--ds-ink); }
.hp-panel-survey { grid-column: 1 / -1; padding: 0; }
.hp-panel-survey .survey-dashboard { margin: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; border-radius: var(--ds-radius-lg); }
.hp-lab-more { margin: 20px 0 0; }
.hp-panel-survey .survey-dashboard .eyebrow { display: none; }
.hp-panel-survey .survey-dashboard h3 { font-family: var(--ds-font-display); color: var(--ds-ink); }
.hp-panel-survey .survey-dashboard-heading p { color: var(--ds-ink-muted); }
.hp-panel-survey .survey-metrics > * { background: var(--ds-ground); border: 1px solid var(--ds-line-subtle); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-md); color: var(--ds-ink); }
.hp-panel-survey .survey-metrics strong { font-family: var(--ds-font-mono); color: var(--ds-ink); }
.hp-panel-survey .mv-survey-feedback { background: var(--ds-ground); border: 1px solid var(--ds-line-subtle); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-md); color: var(--ds-ink-muted); }
</style>
